  "Bryan: 1 × 25 with a 10 lb (≈4.5 kg) dumbbell, holding 1 s at the top.": "Bryan: 1 × 25 me një trap 10 lb (≈4,5 kg), duke mbajtur 1 s në krye.",
  "Bryan: 1 × 50": "Bryan: 1 × 50",
